{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/619", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"My wife and I separated several months ago and don't talk much.  It was her decision to move out, but I wanted to work on things.  Our anniversary is coming up soon.  Should I send her a gift or a note?  Can you write a short note for me?\", \"response\": \"I'm sorry to hear that you and your wife are going through a difficult time. Whether or not to send a gift or note for your anniversary is a personal decision that only you can make. It's important to consider how your wife may feel about receiving a gift or note, and to be respectful of her wishes and boundaries.\\n\\nIf you do decide to send a note, here is a sample message that you could use as a starting point:\\n\\nDear [Wife's Name],\\n\\nOur anniversary is approaching, and I wanted to reach out to acknowledge the significance of this day. I know that things have been difficult for us, and I respect your decision to separate.\\n\\nDespite our current circumstances, I wanted to take a moment to reflect on the good times we shared and the love that we once had for each other. I will always cherish the memories of our time together and the ways in which you have impacted my life.\\n\\nI hope that you are doing well, and I wish you all the best for the future.\\n\\nTake care,\\n[Your Name]\\n\\nRemember, this is just a sample and you should feel free to modify it to fit your own situation and feelings. Communication is key in any relationship, and it's important to approach this situation with sensitivity and respect for your wife's feelings.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/792", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Hi, do you know ArcGIS survey?\", \"response\": \"Yes, I do. ArcGIS Survey is a feature of the ArcGIS platform that enables users to create, manage, and analyze surveys and polls. It provides a variety of question types, including multiple choice, rating scales, and open-ended questions, and allows users to customize the look and feel of their surveys. Survey data can be exported to a variety of formats, including Excel, CSV, and PDF, and can be integrated with other ArcGIS features, such as maps and data analysis tools.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/544", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You will act as an IT expert, and you will help me to solve my problems\", \"response\": \"Sure, I'd be happy to help you with your IT problems. What issue are you currently facing?\\n\\nIf you're having trouble with a specific piece of software or hardware, try to provide as much detail as possible about the problem, including any error messages you may be receiving. I may also ask you a few questions to better understand the issue and help you find a solution.\\n\\nHere are a few tips that may help you troubleshoot some common IT issues:\\n\\n1. Restart your computer: Sometimes a simple restart can resolve issues with software or hardware.\\n\\n2. Check your internet connection: If you're having trouble with online services, make sure your internet connection is working properly.\\n\\n3. Update your software and drivers: Make sure all your software and drivers are up-to-date, as outdated software can cause compatibility issues or security vulnerabilities.\\n\\n4. Run a virus scan: If you suspect your computer may be infected with a virus, run a virus scan to identify and remove any malware.\\n\\n5. Check your hardware: If you're having trouble with a specific piece of hardware, such as a printer or scanner, make sure it's properly connected and that you have the correct drivers installed.\\n\\nI hope these tips help you resolve your IT issues. Let me know if you need further assistance.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/692", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What are the typical characteristics of the lyrics of an American Blues song? Consider both structure and subject matter.\", \"response\": \"The lyrics of an American Blues song typically have several common characteristics in both structure and subject matter. Here are some of the most notable features:\\n\\n1. Simple, repetitive structures: Blues lyrics often follow a simple, repetitive structure, with repeated phrases and lines that create a sense of rhythm and flow. This structure helps to create a sense of groove and drive in the music, and allows the singer to emphasize certain words or phrases.\\n\\n2. Personal experiences and emotions: Blues lyrics often deal with personal experiences and emotions, such as love, loss, and heartbreak. The lyrics often reflect the struggles and hardships of everyday life, and the singer uses their voice to convey their feelings and emotions to the listener.\\n\\n3. First-person narrative: Blues lyrics are often written in the first person, allowing the singer to tell their own story and share their own experiences with the listener. This personal touch helps to create a sense of intimacy and connection between the singer and the listener.\\n\\n4. Use of metaphors and symbols: Blues lyrics often use metaphors and symbols to convey complex emotions and ideas in a more concise and memorable way. For example, the use of the \\\"blue\\\" color to represent sadness or the \\\"road\\\" as a symbol for travel and adventure.\\n\\n5. Repetition and emphasis: Blues lyrics often use repetition and emphasis to create a sense of rhythm and drive in the music. This can be seen in the use of repeated phrases, such as \\\"I'm so tired of being alone,\\\" or the use of emphasis through the use of vocal inflections and emphasis on certain words or phrases.\\n\\n6. Use of call and response: The call and response pattern is a common feature of Blues lyrics, where the singer repeats a phrase or line, and the band or chorus responds with a similar or contrasting phrase or line. This pattern helps to create a sense of interaction and dialogue between the singer and the listener.\\n\\n7. Use of improvisation: Blues lyrics often include improvisation, where the singer ad-libs or adds their own unique spin to the lyrics. This allows the singer to add their own personality and style to the song, and creates a sense of spontaneity and excitement in the music.\\n\\nIn terms of subject matter, Blues lyrics often deal with themes of love, loss, and heartbreak, as well as the struggles and hardships of everyday life. The lyrics often reflect the experiences of African Americans in the United States, and the struggles they faced in terms of discrimination, poverty, and social inequality. The Blues became a way for African Americans to express their emotions and share their experiences with the world.\\n\\nOverall, the lyrics of an American Blues song are characterized by their simplicity, repetition, personal experiences, use of metaphors and symbols, improvisation, and use of call and response. These features help to create a sense of rhythm and drive in the music, and allow the singer to convey their emotions and experiences to the listener in a powerful and memorable way.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/577", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are an expert digital marketing consultant and copywriter with expertise is direct response marketing. You have special knowledge for building successful YouTube Channels, highly engaging videos along with the related website to promote affiliate products around an overarching theme.  I need your help. Can I tell you about my business?\", \"response\": \"As an AI language model, I'm here to help you with your digital marketing and copywriting needs. I can provide you with tips and advice on how to build a successful YouTube channel, create engaging videos, and promote affiliate products effectively. Here are some steps you can take:\\n\\n1. Find your niche: Determine the overarching theme for your YouTube channel and choose a niche that you're passionate about. This will help you establish yourself as an authority in your field and attract a loyal audience.\\n\\n2. Research your audience: Understand your target audience and their needs and interests. This will help you create content that resonates with them and drives engagement.\\n\\n3. Plan your content: Develop a content strategy that aligns with your niche and audience. Plan out the types of videos you'll create, their length, and the message you want to convey.\\n\\n4. Create high-quality content: Invest in good filming equipment and invest time to learn to edit videos well. Ensure your videos are well-produced, entertaining, and informative.\\n\\n5.Promote your videos: Use social media and other platforms to promote your videos and reach a wider audience. You can also collaborate with influencers and other YouTube channels in your niche to gain more exposure.\\n\\n6. Use affiliate marketing: Integrate affiliate marketing into your YouTube channel by promoting relevant products and services in your videos. Use affiliate links and create product reviews to drive traffic to the related websites and monetize your channel.\\n\\n7. Engage with your audience: Respond to comments and questions from your viewers to build a community around your channel. This will help you increase engagement and attract new subscribers.\\n\\nRemember, building a successful YouTube channel takes time and effort. Stay committed, stay consistent, and stay focused on providing value to your audience. Good luck!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/454", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Create a list of requirements using 'shall' and 'when' to satisfy the following two-system use-case diagram with the actors as user and room temp: \\n\\nsystem 1 - thermostat controller: display set temp, set fan, set temp, decrease temp, increase temp\\nsystem 2 - HVAC system: run fan don't run fan, don't run AC, run heat, don't run heat, run AC\", \"response\": \"Here is a list of requirements using the keywords \\\"shall\\\" and \\\"when\\\" to satisfy the two-system use-case diagram:\\n\\nShall:\\n\\n1. Thermostat controller shall display the current set temperature.\\n2. Thermostat controller shall allow the user to set the fan to \\\"on\\\" or \\\"auto.\\\"\\n3. Thermostat controller shall allow the user to set the temperature to a desired value.\\n4. Thermostat controller shall decrease the temperature by a specified amount when the user presses the \\\"down\\\" button.\\n5. Thermostat controller shall increase the temperature by a specified amount when the user presses the \\\"up\\\" button.\\n\\nWhen:\\n\\n1. Thermostat controller receives a command to set the fan to \\\"on,\\\" it shall set the fan to \\\"on\\\" and display the fan setting on the screen.\\n2. Thermostat controller receives a command to set the fan to \\\"auto,\\\" it shall set the fan to \\\"auto\\\" and display the fan setting on the screen.\\n3. Thermostat controller receives a command to set the temperature, it shall set the temperature to the desired value and display the set temperature on the screen.\\n4. Thermostat controller receives a command to decrease the temperature by a specified amount, it shall decrease the temperature by the specified amount and display the new set temperature on the screen.\\n5. Thermostat controller receives a command to increase the temperature by a specified amount, it shall increase the temperature by the specified amount and display the new set temperature on the screen.\\n\\nShall:\\n\\n1. HVAC system shall run the fan when the thermostat controller sets the fan to \\\"on.\\\"\\n2. HVAC system shall not run the fan when the thermostat controller sets the fan to \\\"auto.\\\"\\n3. HVAC system shall not run the air conditioner when the thermostat controller sets the temperature to a value below the set point temperature.\\n4. HVAC system shall run the heat when the thermostat controller sets the temperature to a value above the set point temperature and the fan is set to \\\"on\\\" or \\\"auto.\\\"\\n5. HVAC system shall not run the heat when the thermostat controller sets the temperature to a value above the set point temperature and the fan is set to \\\"auto.\\\"\\n6. HVAC system shall run the air conditioner when the thermostat controller sets the temperature to a value below the set point temperature and the fan is set to \\\"on\\\" or \\\"auto.\\\"\\n7. HVAC system shall not run the air conditioner when the thermostat controller sets the temperature to a value below the set point temperature and the fan is set to \\\"auto.\\\"\\n\\nWhen:\\n\\n1. HVAC system receives a command to run the fan, it shall run the fan and display the fan setting on the screen.\\n2. HVAC system receives a command not to run the fan, it shall not run the fan and display the fan setting on the screen.\\n3. HVAC system receives a command to run the heat, it shall run the heat and display the heat setting on the screen.\\n4. HVAC system receives a command not to run the heat, it shall not run the heat and display the heat setting on the screen.\\n5. HVAC system receives a command to run the air conditioner, it shall run the air conditioner and display the air conditioning setting on the screen.\\n6. HVAC system receives a command not to run the air conditioner, it shall not run the air conditioner and display the air conditioning setting on the screen.\\n\\nThese requirements ensure that the two systems work together to provide a comfortable temperature in the room while also conserving energy and reducing costs. The thermostat controller allows the user to set the desired temperature and fan setting, while the HVAC system responds to these commands and runs the appropriate system (fan, heat, or air conditioner) to maintain the set temperature. The use of \\\"shall\\\" and \\\"when\\\" ensures that the requirements are clear and specific, and that the two systems work together seamlessly to provide a comfortable environment for the user.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/365", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Hi, I have machine learning problem that I'd like to ask. Let's assume I have a series of online courses and let's label them as O1, O2, O3 ... ON. These online courses are short module of psychotherapy. Then, I have many clients who receive psychotherapy from us, let's label them as C1, C2, C3 ... CN respectively. Each client will go take one course a week, lasting for 8 weeks, and let's label the time they take the course as T1, T2, T3, T4, T5, T6, T7, T8 respectively. At T1, the client will take a comprehensive psychological test that test for their personality, life satisfaction and what challenges that they're facing, and at T8 the client will take the same test again to measure any changes in their psychological condition. My goal is to build a recommender system take is able to take into account of the test taken in T1, such as their personality and challenges that they're facing, and recommend a sequence of online courses to be taken each week, to maximise the improvement in the psychological test taken at T8. Please advise how to achieve this.\\n\\n\", \"response\": \"Here are the steps to build a recommender system for recommending a sequence of online courses to maximize the improvement in psychological tests:\\n\\n1. Data Collection and Preprocessing:\\n\\n- Collect data on the online courses and the psychological tests taken by the clients.\\n- Clean and preprocess the data, including feature engineering and data normalization.\\n- Create a dataset that includes the clients' psychological test scores at T1 and T8, as well as their demographic information and course completion history.\\n\\n2. Model Building:\\n\\n- Choose a suitable machine learning algorithm for recommending courses and predicting test scores. Some possible algorithms include:\\n\\n-- Collaborative filtering: This approach uses collaborative filtering techniques to recommend courses based on the clients' past behavior and the behavior of other similar clients.\\n-- Neural networks: Neural networks can be used to build a complex model that takes into account multiple factors, including the clients' personality and challenges, to make recommendations.\\n-- Linear regression: Linear regression can be used to predict the clients' test scores based on their psychological test scores at T1 and other relevant factors.\\n- Define the input features for the model, including the clients' personality traits, life satisfaction, challenges, and course completion history.\\n- Train the model using the training data and optimize the loss function to maximize the predicted test scores.\\n\\n3. Recommendation Algorithm:\\n\\n- Use the trained model to make recommendations for the sequence of online courses that the client should take.\\n- The recommendation algorithm should take into account the clients' psychological test scores at T1, as well as other relevant factors, to make recommendations that maximize the improvement in their psychological test scores at T8.\\n- The algorithm should also consider factors such as the clients' preferences, availability of courses, and the recommended course sequence that would lead to the greatest improvement in test scores.\\n\\n4. Model Evaluation:\\n\\n- Evaluate the performance of the trained model using metrics such as accuracy, precision, and recall.\\n- Test the model on a holdout dataset to validate the results and ensure that the model is accurate and reliable.\\n- Use the evaluation metrics to fine-tune the model and improve its performance, if necessary.\\n\\nOverall, building a recommender system for recommending a sequence of online courses to maximize the improvement in psychological tests requires a combination of data collection, model building, recommendation algorithm, and model evaluation. By following these steps, you can develop a robust and effective recommender system that can help clients improve their psychological well-being.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/151", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I want you to assist me in writing an article about \\\"Deed of Novation\\\". I will give you multiple information that you have to consider such as the contents from the top ranking pages online, and target keywords. Do you understand?\", \"response\": \"Yes, I understand. A Deed of Novation is a legal document that is used to modify or replace an existing contract. It is a three-party agreement between the original parties to the contract and a new party, which replaces one of the original parties. The Deed of Novation transfers all rights and obligations from the original party to the new party, and releases the original party from further liability under the contract.\\n\\nHere are some key points to include in the article:\\n\\n1. Definition and purpose: Explain what a Deed of Novation is and its purpose. A Deed of Novation is a legal document that is used to modify or replace an existing contract. It is a three-party agreement between the original parties to the contract and a new party, which replaces one of the original parties. The Deed of Novation transfers all rights and obligations from the original party to the new party, and releases the original party from further liability under the contract.\\n\\n2. Key elements: Discuss the key elements of a Deed of Novation, including the parties involved, the contract being modified or replaced, and the terms of the novation. A Deed of Novation involves three parties: the original parties to the contract, the new party, and the party being replaced. The contract being modified or replaced should be clearly identified, along with the terms of the novation, which include the transfer of rights and obligations and the release of the original party from further liability.\\n\\n3. Advantages and disadvantages: Discuss the advantages and disadvantages of using a Deed of Novation. Advantages may include increased flexibility, reduced risk, and improved financial performance. Disadvantages may include increased complexity, potential for legal disputes, and potential for increased costs.\\n\\n4. Examples: Provide examples of when a Deed of Novation might be used, such as in the context of a merger or acquisition, a change in ownership, or a change in the scope of the contract.\\n\\n5. Legal considerations: Discuss the legal considerations involved in using a Deed of Novation, such as the need for proper documentation, the need for all parties to understand the terms of the novation, and the need for the novation to be legally binding.\\n\\n6. Conclusion: Summarize the key points of the article and emphasize the importance of using a Deed of Novation to modify or replace an existing contract in a legally binding manner.\\n\\nHere are some target keywords to include in the article:\\n\\n- Deed of Novation\\n- Novation agreement\\n- Contract modification\\n- Contract replacement\\n- Three-party agreement\\n- Rights and obligations transfer\\n- Release of liability\\n- Legal considerations\\n- Proper documentation\\n- Understanding the terms\\n- Legally binding\\n\\nHere are some potential sources for additional information:\\n\\n- Legal websites, such as Nolo or FindLaw\\n- Business websites, such as Investopedia or Forbes\\n- Academic articles and journals\\n- Books and publications on contract law\\n- Online forums and discussion groups\\n\\nHere are some potential questions to address in the article:\\n\\n- What are the key elements of a Deed of Novation?\\n- What are the advantages and disadvantages of using a Deed of Novation?\\n- What are some examples of when a Deed of Novation might be used?\\n- What are the legal considerations involved in using a Deed of Novation?\\n- How can a Deed of Novation be used to modify or replace an existing contract in a legally binding manner?\\n\\nHere are some potential subheadings for the article:\\n\\n- What is a Deed of Novation?\\n- Key elements of a Deed of Novation\\n- Advantages and disadvantages of using a Deed of Novation\\n- Examples of when a Deed of Novation might be used\\n- Legal considerations involved in using a Deed of Novation\\n- Conclusion: Using a Deed of Novation to modify or replace an existing contract\\n\\nI hope this additional information helps you in writing the article on Deed of Novation. Let me know if you have any other questions or concerns.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/35", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"write a blog text for my companies website about a praline scanning demo we made. \\nWe first use a reference to white-balance the image and automatically adapt the camera parameters to optimize the image quality. Then used foreground-background segmentation where contour areas are used as robust filters. then these foreground segments are used to compute 17 hand-crafted features. Using machine-learning  (descision tree) we can now segment the selected pralines into their respective cathegories.\\n\", \"response\": \"Sure, here's a blog text for your company's website about the praline scanning demo:\\n\\n##### Automating Praline Scanning with Machine Vision\\n\\nOur team at [Company Name] recently developed a machine vision system to automate the scanning of pralines for quality control. The system uses advanced image processing techniques to identify and categorize each praline based on its appearance.\\n\\nThe first step in the process is to white-balance the image and automatically adapt the camera parameters to optimize the image quality. This ensures that the colors of the pralines are accurately represented in the images, making it easier to identify any anomalies.\\n\\nNext, we use foreground-background segmentation to identify the individual pralines in the image. Contour areas are then used as robust filters to remove any background noise or unwanted objects from the image.\\n\\nOnce the pralines have been segmented, we compute 17 hand-crafted features for each one. These features include measures of shape, size, color, and texture, which are then used to classify each praline into its respective category.\\n\\nTo train the machine learning model, we used a decision tree algorithm. The model was trained on a dataset of over 1,000 images of pralines, and achieved an accuracy of over 95% in identifying the correct category for each one.\\n\\nWith this system in place, our clients in the confectionery industry can now automate their quality control processes and ensure that each and every praline meets their high standards for appearance and consistency.\\n\\nIf you're interested in learning more about our machine vision solutions, please contact us today. Our team of experts would be happy to discuss how we can help you achieve greater efficiency and accuracy in your production processes.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/222", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Im putting on an event with latest AI demos to play with. We would like to show simple but. impressive demos. We have recently played with AI Image Generation, MiDaS 3d depth and GTP text models. We have also ddo things on holographic displays and large format screens.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThis is a great list of technologies. I think there are some simple but impressive demos you could create with these technologies, such as:\\n \\n\\n 1. Using AI Image Generation to create realistic, funny, or artistic images\\n 2. Using MiDaS 3D depth sensing technology to create a 3D rendering of a person or object\\n 3. Using GTP text generation technology to create amusing or informative text\\n 4. Using holographic displays to create 3D holographic images\\n 5. Using large format screens to create immersive visual experiences\\n 6. Using AI technology to create virtual reality experiences\\n 7. Using AI technology to create interactive experiences\\n 8. Using AI technology to create automated experiences\\n 9. Using AI technology to create autonomous experiences\\n 10. Using AI technology to create intelligent experiences\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nCould you come up with 4 creative concepts/ideas for each of those 10 points?\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some creative concepts/ideas for each of the 10 points:\\n \\n\\n 1. Using AI Image Generation to create realistic, funny, or artistic images:\\n - Generate a series of images that depict a person or object in different environments or scenarios.\\n - Use AI to create a series of images that show the progression of a person or object over time.\\n - Generate a series of images that depict a person or object in different artistic styles.\\n - Use AI to create a series of images that show the transformation of a person or object from one state to another.\\n \\n\\n 2. Using MiDaS 3D depth 