ers to experience a different perspective.\\n - Use large format screens to create an immersive visual experience that allows users to experience a different time period.\\n \\n\\n 6. Using AI technology to create virtual reality experiences:\\n - Create a virtual reality experience that allows users to explore a virtual environment.\\n - Use AI technology to create a virtual reality experience that allows users to interact with a virtual environment.\\n - Create a virtual reality experience that allows users to experience a different perspective.\\n - Use AI technology to create a virtual reality experience that allows users to experience a different time period.\\n \\n\\n 7. Using AI technology to create interactive experiences:\\n - Create an interactive experience that allows users to explore a virtual environment.\\n - Use AI technology to create an interactive experience that allows users to interact with a virtual environment.\\n - Create an interactive experience that allows users to experience a different perspective.\\n - Use AI technology to create an interactive experience that allows users to experience a different time period.\\n \\n\\n 8. Using AI technology to create automated experiences:\\n - Create an automated experience that allows users to explore a virtual environment.\\n - Use AI technology to create an automated experience that allows users to interact with a virtual environment.\\n - Create an automated experience that allows users to experience a different perspective.\\n - Use AI technology to create an automated experience that allows users to experience a different time period.\\n \\n\\n 9. Using AI technology to create autonomous experiences:\\n - Create an autonomous experience that allows users to explore a virtual environment.\\n - Use AI technology to create an autonomous experience that allows users to interact with a virtual environment.\\n - Create an autonomous experience that allows users to experience a different perspective.\\n - Use AI technology to create an autonomous experience that allows users to experience a different time period.\\n \\n\\n 10. Using AI technology to create intelligent experiences:\\n - Create an intelligent experience that allows users to explore a virtual environment.\\n - Use AI technology to create an intelligent experience that allows users to interact with a virtual environment.\\n - Create an intelligent experience that allows users to experience a different perspective.\\n - Use AI technology to create an intelligent experience that allows users to experience a different time period.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/634", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"From where can I get my fingerprint impressions taken in India for PCC from Singapore?\", \"response\": \"To get your fingerprints taken in India for a PCC from Singapore, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Find a certified finger-printing service provider: Check with the Singapore Police Force (SPF) or the Singapore Foreign Police Clearance Certificate (FPCC) website to find a list of certified finger-printing service providers in India.\\n\\n2. Make an appointment: Contact the finger-printing service provider and make an appointment. Some providers may require you to book an appointment in advance, while others may allow you to walk in.\\n\\n3. Bring the necessary documents: When you go to the finger-printing service provider, make sure to bring the following documents:\\n\\n- A completed finger-printing form (available on the SPF website) - A valid passport or identity card - Two sets of fingerprints on the designated paper (also available on the SPF website) - A passport-sized photograph - A fee (check with the provider for the cost)\\n\\n4. Get your fingerprints taken: The finger-printing service provider will take your fingerprints and ensure that they are properly captured and recorded. This process may take around 10-15 minutes.\\n\\n5. Get your fingerprint impression certificate: After your fingerprints have been taken, the provider will give you a Finger-Print Impression Certificate (FPIC) which you can use to apply for your FPCC from the SPF.\\n\\n6. Apply for your FPCC: Once you have your FPIC, you can apply for your FPCC from the SPF. The application process and requirements can be found on the SPF website.\\n\\nIt's important to note that the requirements and process may vary, so it's recommended to check with the SPF and the certified finger-printing service provider for the most up-to-date information.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/428", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"write a prompt to welcome users to PlayTrip, which is a bot that suggests people travel plans based on their musical taste. \", \"response\": \"Hello and welcome to PlayTrip! We're so excited to help you plan your next travel adventure based on your musical taste. Here's how it works: simply tell us your favorite genres of music, and we'll suggest destinations that are known for their vibrant music scenes. Whether you're into rock, pop, hip-hop, or anything in between, we've got you covered.\\n\\nFor example, if you love listening to electronic music, we might suggest a trip to Ibiza, Spain, where you can dance the night away at world-famous clubs like Ushuaia and Pacha. Or, if you're a fan of country music, we could recommend a trip to Nashville, Tennessee, where you can catch live shows at venues like the Grand Ole Opry and the Ryman Auditorium.\\n\\nIn addition to suggesting destinations, we can also help you find the best music festivals to attend, book tickets to concerts and shows, and even recommend specific artists or bands to check out while you're in town. So what are you waiting for? Start planning your dream trip with PlayTrip today!\\n\\nHere are some potential prompts to get you started:\\n\\n- \\\"Hey PlayTrip, I'm looking for a new destination to explore. Can you suggest a place based on my musical taste?\\\"\\n- \\\"I'm a big fan of electronic music. Can you recommend any destinations that are known for their club scene?\\\"\\n- \\\"I'm planning a trip with my friends, and we're all into different genres of music. Can you help us find a destination that caters to everyone's tastes?\\\"\\n- \\\"I'm a country music fan, and I'm planning a trip to Nashville. Can you recommend some must-see venues or events while I'm there?\\\"\\n- \\\"I'm looking for a music festival to attend this summer. Can you suggest some options based on the genres I like?\\\"\\n- \\\"I'm planning a trip to [destination], and I'm looking for some local bands or artists to check out. Can you help me find some options?\\\"\\n\\nWe can't wait to help you plan the perfect trip based on your musical taste!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
